  "notes": "<!-- dsh-notes:zh -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.7\n\n## 修复与打磨\n- 修复运行时契约 CI 未初始化 pnpm 导致的跨平台校验失败。\n- 升级 GitHub Actions 运行时并启用并发取消，减少旧任务竞争和误报。\n\n## 验证\n- 通过 Windows、macOS、Linux 冷安装及运行时契约验证。\n- 通过前端、Rust、契约、无障碍、打包与覆盖率门禁。\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:en -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.7\n\n## Fixed and polished\n- Fixed the runtime-contract CI job failing before pnpm was initialized on supported platforms.\n- Upgraded GitHub Actions runtimes and enabled concurrency cancellation to prevent stale-run races.\n\n## Verification\n- Verified Windows, macOS, and Linux cold-install and runtime-contract checks.\n- Passed frontend, Rust, contract, accessibility, packaging, and coverage gates.\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:end -->",
